# Git Ignore Configuration for InSpec Docker Profile
# Prevents accidental commits of secrets, build artifacts, and system files

## 🔐 SECRET FILES & CREDENTIALS
# Environment variables
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.env.prod
.env.development

# Private keys & certificates
*.pem
*.key
*.pkcs8
*.p8
*.p12
*.pfx
*.crt
*.cer

# API keys & tokens (various formats)
*credentials*
*secret*
*token*
*api_key*
.credentials
.aws/
.docker/config.json
.docker/credentials.store

# SSH & GPG keys
.ssh/
.gnupg/
id_rsa
id_dsa
id_ed25519
*.pub

## 🔧 BUILD & DEPENDENCY ARTIFACTS
# InSpec vendor directory (external dependencies)
vendor/
.inspec_cache/

# Package managers
node_modules/
.bundle/
Gemfile.lock

# Build outputs
*.gem
*.rbc
.pytest_cache/
*.pyc
__pycache__/

## 📊 TEST & REPORT OUTPUTS
# InSpec reports (generated, not version controlled)
report.json
report.html
report.xml
*-report.*
junit-*.xml
coverage/

# Test artifacts
.rspec_status
.coverage

## 💻 IDE & EDITOR FILES
# VS Code
.vscode/
*.code-workspace
.vscode-test/
.vscode-server/

# JetBrains IDEs
.idea/
*.iml
*.iws
*.ipr
.DS_Store

# Vim/Neovim
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.vim/
.netrwhist
tags
TAGS

# Emacs
*~
\#*\#
.\#*
.emacs.d/

# Sublime Text
*.sublime-project
*.sublime-workspace

# TextMate
*.tm_properties

## 🖥️ OS-SPECIFIC FILES
# macOS
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
.TemporaryItems
.VolumeIcon.icns
.com.apple.timemachine.donotpresent

# Windows
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
*.lnk

# Linux
.directory

## 🐳 DOCKER & CONTAINER ARTIFACTS
# Docker
.docker/
docker-compose.override.yml
.dockerignore
Docker.local.yml

# Container runtime
.container/
*.dockerfile.bak

## 📝 LOG & TEMPORARY FILES
# Log files
*.log
*.logs
*-debug.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# Temporary files
tmp/
temp/
*.tmp
*.bak
*.backup
*.swp
*.swo

# Process/pid files
*.pid
*.pid.lock

# OS locks
.lock
.tern-port
*.lck

## 🔍 LOCAL CONFIGURATION & OVERRIDES
# Local development overrides
local.env
local.yml
local.yaml
*.local.*

# Personal notes (should use docs instead)
NOTES.local
TODO.local

## 📦 DEPENDENCY LOCK FILES (GENERATED)
# These are often environment-specific
# Uncomment if your workflow requires committing lock files
# (For this project, inspec.lock IS version controlled for determinism)
# package-lock.json  # <-- INTENTIONALLY NOT IGNORED (deterministic builds)
# Gemfile.lock       # <-- INTENTIONALLY NOT IGNORED (deterministic builds)

## 🎯 PROJECT-SPECIFIC IGNORES
# InSpec profile runs
.last_run_log
profile_results.json

# Secrets scanning/detection artifacts
.truffleHog/
.gitleaks/

# Integration test artifacts
test-results/
test-output/

## 📋 IMPORTANT NOTES
# This .gitignore is designed to:
# 1. Prevent accidental commits of secrets (keys, tokens, credentials)
# 2. Exclude generated build artifacts (vendor/, reports)
# 3. Ignore OS/IDE-specific files (.DS_Store, .vscode/)
# 4. Exclude logs, temp files, and local overrides
#
# EXCEPTION: inspec.lock is intentionally version-controlled
# Reason: Ensures deterministic dependency resolution across environments
# See: ai-track-docs/DEPENDENCIES.md for detailed pinning strategy
#
# For security concerns or suspected leaked secrets, see:
# See: ai-track-docs/SECURITY.md
